※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 7014 LANG_MACRO_WRITES_STATEMENTS

※ A template whose contents are indented holds statements, and what it writes
※ replaces a line.  Written where a value stands there is no line to replace and
※ nothing for the expression to come to.

macro keep:
    ⌜$x⌝ → ⌜
        let q: u8 = $x
    ⌝

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    ⎕narrow(keep⌜1u8⌝, ⌜u6⌝) ?? 1u6
